<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re sets 500 mln Sfr domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re sets 500 mln Sfr domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the lead manager:</p>
<p>    BORROWER  = SWISS RE	COUPON = 3-3/4 PCT</p>
<p>    LEAD MGR  = CSFB	    PRICE = 102.25</p>
<p>    LISTING   = Swiss	   YLD AT ISSUE = 3.69 PCT</p>
<p>    DENOMS (K)= 5,000	   SETTLEMENT = 02.JUL.97</p>
<p>					MATURITY = 02.JUL.07</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
